// grid.kwxts — kwxTypeScript port of wxSamples/src/grid/griddemo.cpp
//
// A faithful port of everything the public binding surface exposes: the frame,
// the complete menu tree, the populated grid, the log pane and every connected
// event. Features that require a C++ virtual override or an unbound wxGrid
// method are reported by their menu handler (see handlers.kwxts) instead of
// being silently dropped.
//
// Run from the repository root:
//   bin\Release\kwxts.exe samples\grid\grid.kwxts

